WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.440
Home...

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.980
...curfew?

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.570
Yes.

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.990
What did that Urushibara do?

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.030
I haven't been informed, either.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:16.570
Lesya-oneesama is absent, too...

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.700
I see...

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.520
I'll go check on them later.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.800
I'm glad you came, Moroha.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:03.060
Wait, what happened to you?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.960
Don't worry about it.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.510
Do you know what a maneater is?

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.060
A maneater?

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.470
A demon sword-wielding, Plana and Mana 
eating assassin from the Russia branch.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.430
Apparently Sir Edward's 
been hurt before, too.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:22.490
Listen carefully, Moroha.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.040
Elena-san is a maneater.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.040
Lesya's an assassin?

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.400
There must be some mistake.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.800
No, I...

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.840
went to confirm it, yesterday.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.340
How could you?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:47.050
I went to fight without even 
giving you so much as a warning.

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:50.350
Not even you could forgive me this time, huh?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.040
But I'm not wrong.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.110
Forget it.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.860
Listen to me, Moroha, the Russia branch...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.490
I said forget it!

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.740
I'm glad you're safe.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:08.590
Moroha.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:11.760
Please, be more careful with yourself.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.190
If something were to happen to you, I...

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.750
I'm sorry.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.640
Even if Lesya is a maneater, 
I'm not changing anything.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.510
I can't believe she's a bad person deep down.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.200
Lesya.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.960
Lesya!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.570
Lesya!

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.960
Get up!

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.710
It's not the time to be resting.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:02.720
Haimura might have found out who you are.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.410
I know.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.220
Why didn't you kill Urushibara?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.230
Don't you want to complete your mission 
and live happily with your brother?

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.720
I know.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.510
I know that.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.220
It's not safe here.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.130
Oh, so you <i>are</i> here.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:43.470
You shouldn't peep through her window.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.120
It's an invasion of privacy.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.660
W-Well...

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.890
Hey.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.740
Sorry about Shizuno yesterday.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:58.430
Ice dark magic with an added curse, huh?

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.650
Shizuno can be pretty macabre.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:09.390
It'll take a while, but I'll take 
responsibility in making you better.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:12.050
There are lots of dark mages in Russia, too,

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:16.480
but no one ever used this 
kind of dark magic on me.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.130
Kept you waiting.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.340
It's my specialty risotto.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.660
Can you get up?

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.630
If not, I can feed you.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.410
I'm not letting you play "say, ahh" with another woman in

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.200
front of your own sister, Nii-sama.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.700
Come on.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.300
Are you two really siblings?

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.250
Yeah, in our past lives, to be exact.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.580
I don't believe it.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.400
It would take a miracle for siblings 
to be reincarnated into the same age.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.750
Love creates miracles!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:54.120
Love aside, I think every time 
you meet someone it's a miracle.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:59.880
Even you and I, we're together right now 
because of a ton of miraculous coincidences.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.150
Come on, I'll feed you.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.530
Say ahh.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.340
Dude, dude!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.640
I'll go get water.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.640
Sorry!

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.720
Ranjou Satsuki hates me. I knew it.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.460
This is quite an elaborate harassment.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.280
Time to die.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:21.110
I said I'm sorry, come on, forgive me!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.610
What the heck are you doing?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.720
What is your relationship 
with Haimura Moroha?

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:54.600
I'm harem personnel of the future.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.610
Tee-hee.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.510
I don't understand.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:09.110
Why do onions make you cry so much?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.860
Water! Water!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:18.660
Ta-da!

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:23.420
I thought you might be missing 
your hometown cooking by now.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.920
Borscht.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:28.990
How is it?

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:29.890
Do you like it?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.390
Thank goodness.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.130
There's more, too.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.840
Eat well, sleep well and get well soon, okay?

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.130
Got it.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.370
You can call me if you get lonely at night.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:44.960
Got it.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.810
Maya's the world's cutest body pillow.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:48.860
I am.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:52.950
Wait, do you mean you're 
using Maya as a body pillow?

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.040
Yes.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.810
Seriously?

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:57.160
No, you're kidding, right?

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.160
Hi, Elena.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.050
Are you enjoying Japan?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:06.800
Yes.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.290
Me, too.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.740
I'm even thinking of joining the 
Japan branch after I graduate.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:16.530
I think you should think about it, too.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.370
Moroha!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.300
Hey.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.560
I...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.100
can't betray my brother.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.860
I see.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:39.040
But you'll like the people 
at school even more.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.870
You're going to want to live 
in Japan, I guarantee it.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.120
If you stay here.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:48.000
<i>This mission is a failure.</i>

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.120
I'm back.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.410
Welcome back.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.810
I'm glad you're feeling better, 
but don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.780
I can handle it.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.890
So I have a request to make of you.

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:09.480
Take me on a date, on the next break.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.530
<b>North Mitama City Sports Park</b>

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.020
Are you certain?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.170
Thank you.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.280
Hello?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.500
It's me.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.440
Has Moroha said anything 
about going out today?

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:54.690
Actually, hear me out, Urushibara!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.450
Nii-sama's on a date with Lesya again!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.060
You're not going to put your arm 
through mine or anything today?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.160
Replazan.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.950
I'm a maneater.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:44.660
With a single swing of my demon sword 
I kill anyone who opposes Russia.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.290
Lesya.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.960
Haimura Moroha.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.790
I will now kill you.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.570
Are you really serious?

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.000
I can't believe Lesya's an assassin.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.220
We'll talk later.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.300
You need to hurry ahead.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.930
Sophie-senpai.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.890
Sorry, I can't let you through here.

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.690
But why?

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.940
You want Moroha to defeat 
the pesky Russian assassin.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.450
Is that what the US branch is thinking?

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.630
Sophie-senpai...

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:29.160
Shizuno, let me handle this.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.560
Thanks.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:34.050
I said I'm not letting you through.

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:36.800
She's fast.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.430
Let's fight, Senpai.

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:55.440
<i>She's strong.</i>

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.820
<i>She's absorbing Plana!</i>

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.740
<b>Piercing will!</b>

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:07.740
Piercing will!

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:15.880
<i>So this is the power of the demon sword.</i>

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:25.750
I can't keep this up.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.760
Gorikitsu!

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.910
<i>She can absorb, even when 
our swords aren't touching?</i>

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.710
Why don't you strike me down?

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:05.220
Weren't you going to kill me?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.820
You improved at summer camp, huh, Satsuki?

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:28.570
It's not like I'm not trying!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.590
I'm going to get serious, too, then.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.110
Don't die!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.830
<b>Cycle Monorail</b>

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.240
<i>I'm not getting anywhere 
just defending myself.</i>

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.050
<i>But what am I supposed to do?</i>

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.020
Why?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:57.920
A normal Shirogane would use sword 
techniques that involve Plana.

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:01.110
Why do you train in swordsmanship itself?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.610
I don't know.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.780
Maybe it's because things never 
worked out for me in the beginning,

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:07.550
and I had to struggle.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.710
<i>I'm not done yet.</i>

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.090
<i>I can still keep it up.</i>

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:29.280
<i>I can improve myself a lot more.</i>

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.570
I remember!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.530
What's this about, Haimura Moroha?

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:47.780
I don't know, you should try it yourself.

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:52.720
I understand.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:14.010
It's crumbling!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:19.180
In my past life, I could never find 
a weapon that could keep up with me.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.720
Just how much Plana do you have?!

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.120
Dirty American extravagance!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.530
No more talking.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.310
Have courage!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.200
Light the flame in your heart!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.990
You can do it, Satsuki!

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.590
I don't mind you being pumped up inside.

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:42.020
In fact, be strong of will, but calm of mind.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:49.920
Kongoutsu!

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:06.650
I can't fight without my weapon.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.920
I lose, Satsuki you overachiever.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.170
So cute! So cute!

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:15.240
Senpai, I'm going to suffocate!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.700
Go ahead, pick it up.

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:27.460
But I think the result will be the same, 
no matter how many times you try.

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.720
I have to kill you.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.050
For your brother?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:49.980
Your brother's going to be killed 
unless I am? Something like that?

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.330
Then I'll help.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.810
I'll save your brother from 
the Lightning Emperor.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.960
Then you'll be free. Right, Lesya?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.710
It can't be done.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.420
I couldn't save my parents.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.470
I don't want you to go 
through the same thing.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:21.220
I'm going to save him. I promise.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.730
I... My brother...

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.080
Moroha!

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.430
Stop now.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:36.740
You don't have a reason to fight each other.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:41.310
Elena-san, you don't have a brother.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:44.250
What are you talking about, 
Urushibara Shizuno?

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.500
The president of the institution told me.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:51.750
You were abandoned, alone on 
the night of a snow storm.

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:03.350
Just you, alone, moments after being born.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:09.120
Don't you think it makes no sense 
that you'd have a biological brother?

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.610
I don't need your silly lies!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.940
Then can you say your brother's name?

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:18.030
My brother's name...

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.950
My brother's name...

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.030
Can you remember what he looks like?

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.450
How old is he?

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:26.250
His face?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:27.960
His age?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.620
I can't remember.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.140
Why?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:34.960
Why?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:38.760
Because Urushibara-san is right.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.970
Nice to meet you.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.220
I'm Condrat, of the Russia branch.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.010
What's going on, Condrat?

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:49.480
Where's my brother?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.270
He's a figment.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:53.810
Huh?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.430
I implanted it in you.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:59.550
The illusion that you have a brother.

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:03.150
Human illusions are a pesky thing.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.470
You might have figured it out if you'd 
given even just a little consideration,

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:08.750
but you'd neglected the thought for years.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:12.840
How could you treat a 
person's mind like that?

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.770
I see.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.340
I was alone.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.310
I could have died.

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:29.790
Lesya!

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.740
It's no use.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.570
I'm sure she'll listen to no one now.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.320
What?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.320
Me?

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.850
I'm over here.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:54.440
Even a Savior's body can be taken 
over if their mind is broken.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:00.110
How about we continue the swordplay?

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:04.270
Though I'm sure it'll be difficult fighting 
and protecting Urushibara-san at the same time.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.700
You did well, Lesya.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.960
Haimura can't kill you.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:40.880
It seems that immense Plana 
of yours is backfiring on you.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.390
How long do you plan on sleeping?

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.350
I remember now.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.000
So should you.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:55.190
Saratiga!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.040
Wh-What?!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.950
Tranquilize!

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.030
Don't say you could have died.

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:25.000
That's so sad.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.180
If you need a reason to 
live, I'll be that reason.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:34.440
I'll be your family.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:51.040
My eyes!

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.640
Ow! Ow!

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:58.130
Who said you could touch my feet?

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:02.130
I do not forgive failure.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:10.160
That Haimura seems to have destroyed only 
the mind that dwelt in the maneater.

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.640
How kind of him.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:20.900
Why?

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:23.900
I figured you'd do this.

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.440
I don't want to get you involved.

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:29.400
You're so stubborn.

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:30.660
Sorry.

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:38.500
But thanks for everything, Haimura Moroha.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:40.460
Sleep near death.

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:48.150
Hi, Jack.

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:50.740
You're rarely the one to call me.

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:53.180
<i>I need to ask you for a favor.</i>

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.240
<i>I want to go to war with the Russia branch.</i>

00:23:57.670 --> 00:23:59.000
By myself.

00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:01.570
<i>Elena Arshavina.</i>

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:05.870
<i>May her life be repaired 
into a brightly shining one,</i>

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:08.010
<i>like the holy sword Saratiga.</i>

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:14.320
<i>That prayer is what sparked 
Haimura Moroha to fight.</i>

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:17.990
Moroha, how many children do you want?

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:20.110
That's not what I meant by family!

00:24:20.110 --> 00:24:23.070
Next time, episode nine: "To Siberia."

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.110
Break through the stormy present life.
